# DGX Spark fleet (local-inference)

Before changing LiteLLM config, DGX networking, NVIDIA Sync, QSFP clustering, or
`local-glm52-experimental` routing, read:

**`docs/runbooks/dgx-spark-fleet.md`**

## Stable client contract

- Proxy URL: `http://100.92.253.61:4000/v1` (spark-b4ec Tailscale; prefer over LAN)
- Aliases: `local-primary`, `local-fast`, `local-glm52-experimental`
- Never point loops at a Spark model port (`:8000`) directly — only the LiteLLM proxy on spark-b4ec `:4000`

