## Next gate

QSFP cable + Bell LAN ethernet → Cluster Assistant (2-node) → NCCL → vLLM/GLM →
update `litellm/config.yaml` per `litellm/config.dgx.example.yaml`.

## Pitfalls

- No `Dell-Direct` / `192.168.137.x` on Sparks — Bell LAN only
- NVIDIA Sync: use `100.x` IP, not `.ts.net` MagicDNS
- Do not run GLM on the Dell tower
